'''Manic Macho Legs''' (大狂乱のムキあしネコ ''Dai Kyōran no Mukiashi Neko'', '''Insane Muscular Legs Cat''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy found in [[Muscle Party (Deadly)|Muscle Party]]. He was added in [[Version 5.0 Update|Version 5.0]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Manic Macho Legs
|image = E 245.png
|appearance = [[Muscle Party (Deadly)]]
[[Infernal Tower/Floor 33|Infernal Tower - Floor 33]]
|money drop = 810¢ - 3,199¢
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy has high health (though lower than most other enemy variants of Manic Cats), high attack power and creates a Lv.4 [[Wave Attack]]. Cats with high attack power like [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]] and/or a stack of ranged attackers will make short work of it, but don't expect just one to show up.

This enemy becomes far easier if the player has access to [[:Category:Wave Shield Cats|Wave Shields]] like [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]].

